=2 Walkthrough
* While the quest {q:Ode to the Serpents|Ode to the Serpents|Ode to the Serpents} is active, speak to {n:Talhaal} in {z:Al Zahbi} (H-6).
* Speak to {n:Fari-Wari} in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (K-12).
